  "effortLevel": "high",
  "askUserQuestionTimeout": "never",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "remoteControlAtStartup": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: private (andrewwbuilds/drone-agent, confirmed via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: default branch unknown (origin/HEAD unset); no rulesets or protected branches listed",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (andrewwbuilds/drone-agent) and its origin remote only",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar — note .env / .env.local are gitignored and .env.example documents ANTHROPIC_API_KEY as a required secret",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (natural-language drone simulator project)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /Users/andrewwang/git repos/drone-agent (github.com/andrewwbuilds/drone-agent), private — confidential material is fine here, but content ported or first read from outside this repo is not its own work",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "routine under andrewwbuilds/ prefix: git and gh operations scoped to the drone-agent repo and its origin remote"
    ]
  }
